#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "80_Akiyama"
msgid "Honestly, I didn't expect you to do this well."
msgstr "Sinceramente, no esperaba que lo hicieras tan bien."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92_Shiobara"
msgid "Please, a loss is a loss... But I guess I did do pretty\\r\nwell, didn't I?"
msgstr "Una derrota es una derrota, no hace falta decorarla...\\r\nPero lo hice bastante bien a pesar de todo, ¿no cree?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "104_Akiyama"
msgid "Absolutely."
msgstr "Absolutamente."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "116_Akiyama"
msgid "When it comes down to it, the trick is in fulfilling\\r\ncustomers' needs over and over against practically\\r\nmiraculous odds."
msgstr "Al final, el truco está en cumplir con lo que los\\r\nclientes quieren una y otra vez, aunque conseguirlo\\r\nparezca un milagro."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "128_Akiyama"
msgid "In fact, it's pretty much the ideal sales model."
msgstr "De hecho, es la forma ideal de hacer negocios."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "140_Akiyama"
msgid "By quickly feeling out the locals' needs and supplying just\\r\nthe right goods, you wound up with a very valuable prize."
msgstr "Al comprender las necesidades locales y proveer los\\r\nproductos adecuados, obtuviste un artículo muy valioso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "152_Akiyama"
msgid "You've got a pretty good knack for business, if you ask me."
msgstr "En mi opinión, posees un talento nato para los negocios."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "164_Shiobara"
msgid "Is that what you were trying to test?"
msgstr "¿Estabas tratando de comprobar eso con la prueba...?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176_Akiyama"
msgid "One of the things, anyway."
msgstr "Bueno, supongo que era una de las razones."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "188_Shiobara"
msgid "...I don't get you, Akiyama-san. You always seem like you're\\r\njust goofing around, then, next thing I know, you zero in on\\r\nsomething profound like that..."
msgstr "...No te entiendo, Akiyama-san. Siempre pareces estar\\r\nbromeando, pero la realidad es que detrás de esa\\r\nfachada hay algo más profundo de lo que aparenta..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "200_Akiyama"
msgid "You overestimate me. Mostly I just say whatever comes to\\r\nmind."
msgstr "Lo estás exagerando un poco. Usualmente solo digo lo que\\r\npienso en el momento."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "212_Shiobara"
msgid "No, you really are special. I'm glad I was able to do as\\r\nwell as I did against an opponent like you."
msgstr "No, realmente eres increíble. Estoy orgulloso de haberlo\\r\nhecho tan bien contra un rival como tú..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "224_Shiobara"
msgid "...I almost feel like I could start over."
msgstr "...Siento que podría intentarlo de nuevo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "236_Shiobara"
msgid "I may be down, but I'm not out! I did all this with a single\\r\ncigarette－and I can do more!"
msgstr "¡Estar sin dinero es lo máximo! Logré llegar hasta acá con\\r\nun simple cigarrillo... ¡Imagina las posibilidades!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "248_Akiyama"
msgid "There's that twinkle in your eye!"
msgstr "¡Esa mirada tuya lo dice todo!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "260_Shiobara"
msgid "Thank you, Akiyama-san. I knew I was drawn back to this part\\r\nof town for a reason－it was to see you!"
msgstr "Gracias, Akiyama-san. Al final, creo que volví inconscientemente\\r\na la ciudad, solo para volver a encontrarme contigo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "272_Shiobara"
msgid "Be on the lookout for me! I just know I'm going to make it\\r\nbig again one day!"
msgstr "¡El mundo aún no ha visto lo mejor de mí, volveré a la cima!\\r\n¡Ya lo verás!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "284_Akiyama"
msgid "Yeah. Counting on it."
msgstr "Espero con ansias ver eso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "296_Shiobara"
msgid "Thanks! See you!"
msgstr "¡Gracias! ¡Nos vemos!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "320_Akiyama"
msgid "Shiobara?"
msgstr "Shiobara."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "332_Shiobara"
msgid "Yes?"
msgstr "¿Sí?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "344_Akiyama"
msgid "Here. You forgot this."
msgstr "Ten. Olvidaste esto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "380_Shiobara"
msgid "Oof! Did you have to throw it? I can't think of anything\\r\nI've forg..."
msgstr "¡Ay! ¿Por qué lo lanzaste?\\r\nNo recuerdo haber olvidado..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "392_Shiobara"
msgid "Huh!? It's money."
msgstr "¡¿Eh?! ¿Esto no es dinero?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "404_Akiyama"
msgid "Yep. Five million, to be exact."
msgstr "En efecto. Cinco millones, para ser exactos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "416_Shiobara"
msgid "But why?"
msgstr "Pero, ¿por qué?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "428_Akiyama"
msgid "I lent you five million and you insisted on returning ten\\r\nmillion."
msgstr "Te presté cinco millones y te empeñaste en devolverme\\r\ndiez millones."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "440_Akiyama"
msgid "\"No interest, no collateral.\" Hasn't that sunk in yet?"
msgstr "¿No te lo he repetido más de una vez? Sin intereses."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "452_Akiyama"
msgid "That money is yours."
msgstr "Ese dinero de ahí, es tuyo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "464_Shiobara"
msgid "Akiyama-san..."
msgstr "Akiyama-san..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "476_Akiyama"
msgid "Just promise me one thing. My customers never come back for\\r\nseconds."
msgstr "Y recuerda lo otro. Mis clientes nunca vuelven a pedirme\\r\nprestado dinero."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "488_Akiyama"
msgid "Either they fail the test and leave angry, or they pass the\\r\ntest and change their lives forever. One of the two."
msgstr "O fallan la prueba y se marchan furiosos, o bien la superan\\r\ny sus vidas cambian para siempre. Una de las dos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "500_Akiyama"
msgid "It would be a real shame if my apprentice wound up being my\\r\nvery first repeat customer."
msgstr "Sería una vergonzoso que mi aprendiz termine siendo\\r\nmi primer cliente recurrente."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "512_Shiobara"
msgid "...Right! I'll do my very best!"
msgstr "... ¡Entiendo! ¡Me esforzaré al máximo!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "524_Akiyama"
msgid "Later!"
msgstr "¡Hasta luego!"

